{
    "comment": "내보내기 작업 표. 쪽 넘김은 서버가 하고(`serverSidePagination`), 쪽 번호는 URL 에 남는다.\n  파일명은 내려받을 수 있을 때(완료 + 다운로드 권한 + 범위 + 원본 조회 권한 — 서버 `abilities.can_download`)만\n  링크 모양 버튼이고 그 밖에는 글자다. 응답이 파일이라 코어 apiCall 로는 받지 못해 이 모듈의\n  `sirsoft-ecommerce.downloadExportFile` 이 60초·1회용 주소를 발급받아 브라우저가 그 주소를 직접 열게 한다(파일을\n  메모리에 올리지 않는다) — 받은 뒤 목록을 다시 불러 「n회」를 갱신한다.\n  「n회」를 누르면 다운로드 이력 창이 열린다. 행마다 **펼침 줄**(`<sub-row>`)에 요청 조건 요약이 붙는다 —\n  같은 유형의 파일이 여럿일 때 무엇으로 뽑은 파일인지 이름만으로는 알 수 없다.\n  행 메뉴(내려받기·다운로드 이력·다시 요청·삭제)는 서버 abilities 로 잠긴다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Export Index DataGrid"
    },
    "id": "export_datagrid",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "DataGrid",
    "blur_until_loaded": {
        "enabled": true,
        "data_sources": "exports"
    },
    "actions": [
        {
            "comment": "체크한 작업 id 묶음 — 일괄 작업 줄과 확인 창이 함께 보므로 지역이 아니라 전역에 둔다.",
            "type": "change",
            "event": "onSelectionChange",
            "handler": "setState",
            "params": {
                "target": "global",
                "ecommerceExportBulkSelectedItems": "{{$args[0]}}"
            }
        },
        {
            "comment": "쪽 이동 — 쪽 번호만 갈아끼우고 나머지 조건은 그대로 둔다. 표 본문에만 전환 효과를 건다.",
            "type": "change",
            "event": "onPageChange",
            "handler": "navigate",
            "params": {
                "path": "/admin/ecommerce/exports",
                "replace": true,
                "mergeQuery": true,
                "transition_overlay_target": "export_datagrid__body",
                "query": {
                    "page": "{{$args[0]}}"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "comment": "행 메뉴 — 내려받기는 곧장 받고, 이력·다시 요청·삭제는 그 행 전체를 `_global.ecommerceExportTarget` 에 담은 뒤 창을 연다(창들이 조회 없이 이 값을 읽는다).",
            "type": "action",
            "event": "onRowAction",
            "handler": "switch",
            "cases": {
                "download": {
                    "handler": "sequence",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "global",
                                "ecommerceExportDownloadingId": "{{$args[1].id}}"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "handler": "sirsoft-ecommerce.downloadExportFile",
                            "params": {
                                "url": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/exports/{{$args[1].id}}/download-link",
                                "filename": "{{$args[1].file_name}}"
                            },
                            "onSuccess": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "ecommerceExportDownloadingId": null
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                    "params": {
                                        "dataSourceId": "exports"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "onError": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "ecommerceExportDownloadingId": null
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "toast",
                                    "params": {
                                        "type": "error",
                                        "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.messages.download_failed"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                    "params": {
                                        "dataSourceId": "exports"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "view_downloads": {
                    "handler": "sequence",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "global",
                                "ecommerceExportTarget": "{{$args[1]}}",
                                "ecommerceExportDownloadsPage": 1
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "handler": "openModal",
                            "target": "export_downloads_modal"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "retry": {
                    "handler": "sequence",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "global",
                                "ecommerceExportTarget": "{{$args[1]}}",
                                "ecommerceExportRetryReason": null
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "handler": "openModal",
                            "target": "export_retry_modal"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "delete": {
                    "handler": "sequence",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "global",
                                "ecommerceExportTarget": "{{$args[1]}}"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "handler": "openModal",
                            "target": "export_delete_modal"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            }
        }
    ],
    "props": {
        "pageHref": "/admin/ecommerce/exports?page={page}",
        "pageHrefMergeQuery": true,
        "rowLabelField": "file_name",
        "data": "{{exports?.data?.data || []}}",
        "idField": "id",
        "selectable": true,
        "selectionScope": "page",
        "selectedIds": "{{_global.ecommerceExportBulkSelectedItems || []}}",
        "selectedCountText": "",
        "emptyMessage": "{{exports === undefined ? '' : $t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.empty')}}",
        "pagination": true,
        "serverSidePagination": true,
        "serverCurrentPage": "{{exports?.data?.pagination?.current_page ?? 1}}",
        "serverTotalPages": "{{exports?.data?.pagination?.last_page ?? null}}",
        "serverHasMorePages": "{{exports?.data?.pagination?.has_more_pages ?? false}}",
        "pageSize": "{{+(query.per_page || 20)}}",
        "alwaysShowPagination": true,
        "subRowClassName": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-3 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:bg-gray-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:whitespace-normal ecommerce:shadow-sm",
        "rowActions": [
            {
                "id": "download",
                "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.action.download",
                "iconName": "download",
                "disabledField": "abilities.can_download"
            },
            {
                "id": "view_downloads",
                "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.action.view_downloads",
                "iconName": "clock-rotate-left",
                "disabledField": "abilities.can_view_downloads"
            },
            {
                "id": "retry",
                "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.action.retry",
                "iconName": "rotate-right",
                "disabledField": "abilities.can_retry"
            },
            {
                "id": "divider",
                "divider": true
            },
            {
                "id": "delete",
                "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.action.delete",
                "iconName": "fa-regular fa-trash-can",
                "variant": "danger",
                "disabledField": "abilities.can_delete"
            }
        ],
        "columns": [
            {
                "field": "requested_at",
                "header": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.column.requested_at",
                "width": "150px",
                "cellChildren": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce-text-body ecommerce:whitespace-nowrap"
                        },
                        "text": "{{row.requested_at ?? '-'}}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "field": "requester",
                "header": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.column.requester",
                "width": "160px",
                "cellChildren": [
                    {
                        "type": "composite",
                        "name": "ActionMenu",
                        "if": "{{!!row.requester?.uuid}}",
                        "actions": [
                            {
                                "comment": "요청자 메뉴 — 회원 상세는 **새 창** 링크로 열고(이 목록의 검색 조건을 잃지 않게 — 항목의 href·target), 요청자로 거르기는 같은 창에서 검색 조건만 갈아끼운다.\n                 필터 칸에는 「요청자」 검색과 이름을 담아 무엇으로 걸렀는지 보이고, 실제 거르기는 회원 고유ID(`requester_uuid`)로 한다 —\n                 이름 포함 검색만으로는 「홍길동」을 고르면 「홍길동2」의 작업도 섞인다.",
                                "event": "onItemClick",
                                "handler": "switch",
                                "cases": {
                                    "search_member": {
                                        "comment": "같은 화면 안에서 주소만 바뀌면 진입 `<init>` 이 다시 돌지 않으므로 필터 칸도 함께 채운다",
                                        "handler": "sequence",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "handler": "setState",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "target": "_local",
                                                    "filter.searchField": "requester",
                                                    "filter.search": "{{row.requester?.name ?? ''}}"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "handler": "navigate",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "path": "/admin/ecommerce/exports",
                                                    "mergeQuery": true,
                                                    "replace": true,
                                                    "transition_overlay_target": "export_datagrid__body",
                                                    "query": {
                                                        "search_field": "requester",
                                                        "search_keyword": "{{row.requester?.name}}",
                                                        "requester_uuid": "{{row.requester?.uuid}}",
                                                        "page": 1
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        ],
                        "props": {
                            "position": "right",
                            "items": [
                                {
                                    "id": "view_member",
                                    "href": "/admin/users/{{row.requester.uuid}}",
                                    "target": "_blank",
                                    "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.requester_menu.view_member",
                                    "iconName": "user"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "search_member",
                                    "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.requester_menu.search_member",
                                    "iconName": "magnifying-glass"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:min-w-0 ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:px-1 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:transition-colors ecommerce:cursor-pointer"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Icon",
                                        "props": {
                                            "name": "fa-regular fa-user",
                                            "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-400 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-500 ecommerce:flex-shrink-0"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-col ecommerce:min-w-0"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Span",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "ecommerce-text-body ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:truncate"
                                                },
                                                "text": "{{row.requester?.name ?? '-'}}"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Span",
                                                "if": "{{row.requester?.email}}",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400 ecommerce:truncate"
                                                },
                                                "text": "{{row.requester?.email}}"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "comment": "회원이 탈퇴·삭제돼 연결이 끊긴 요청자는 요청 때 남긴 이름만 글자로 보인다",
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Div",
                        "if": "{{!row.requester?.uuid}}",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-col ecommerce:min-w-0"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce-text-body ecommerce:truncate"
                                },
                                "text": "{{row.requester?.name ?? '-'}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "if": "{{row.requester?.email}}",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400 ecommerce:truncate"
                                },
                                "text": "{{row.requester?.email}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "field": "file_name",
                "header": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.column.file_name",
                "width": "320px",
                "cellChildren": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Div",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:flex-wrap ecommerce:min-w-0"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Button",
                                "if": "{{row.abilities?.can_download === true && row.file_name}}",
                                "actions": [
                                    {
                                        "comment": "내려받기 — 서버가 다운로드 이력을 남기고 횟수를 올린다. 성공·실패 모두 진행 표시를 풀고, 성공이면 목록을 다시 불러 「n회」를 갱신한다(만료·삭제 직후라 실패하면 목록이 최신 상태를 보여 주도록 실패 갈래도 다시 부른다).",
                                        "type": "click",
                                        "handler": "sequence",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "handler": "setState",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "target": "global",
                                                    "ecommerceExportDownloadingId": "{{row.id}}"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "handler": "sirsoft-ecommerce.downloadExportFile",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "url": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/exports/{{row.id}}/download-link",
                                                    "filename": "{{row.file_name}}"
                                                },
                                                "onSuccess": [
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "global",
                                                            "ecommerceExportDownloadingId": null
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "dataSourceId": "exports"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                                "onError": [
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "global",
                                                            "ecommerceExportDownloadingId": null
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "toast",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "type": "error",
                                                            "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.messages.download_failed"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "dataSourceId": "exports"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ],
                                "props": {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-left ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-blue-600 ecommerce:dark:text-blue-400 ecommerce:hover:underline ecommerce:break-all ecommerce-break-all ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                    "disabled": "{{_global.ecommerceExportDownloadingId === row.id}}"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Icon",
                                        "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportDownloadingId === row.id}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "name": "spinner",
                                            "className": "ecommerce-spinner-sm"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "text": "{{row.file_name}}"
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "if": "{{!(row.abilities?.can_download === true && row.file_name)}}",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-gray-600 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400 ecommerce:break-all ecommerce-break-all"
                                },
                                "text": "{{row.file_name ?? $t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.file_waiting')}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "if": "{{row.contains_personal_data}}",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:inline-flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:px-1.5 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:bg-red-100 ecommerce:text-red-800 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-red-300"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.personal_badge"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Button",
                                "if": "{{row.abilities?.can_view_downloads === true}}",
                                "actions": [
                                    {
                                        "comment": "다운로드 횟수 — 누르면 이 작업의 다운로드 이력 창을 연다(창이 열릴 때 이력을 받는다. 서버가 「이력 조회」 활동 로그를 남긴다).",
                                        "type": "click",
                                        "handler": "sequence",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "handler": "setState",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "target": "global",
                                                    "ecommerceExportTarget": "{{row}}",
                                                    "ecommerceExportDownloadsPage": 1
                                                }
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "handler": "openModal",
                                                "target": "export_downloads_modal"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ],
                                "props": {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400 ecommerce:hover:underline ecommerce:whitespace-nowrap"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:defer:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.download_count|count={{row.download_count ?? 0}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "field": "type_label",
                "header": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.column.type",
                "width": "120px",
                "cellChildren": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce-text-body"
                        },
                        "text": "{{row.type_label}}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "field": "status",
                "header": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.column.status",
                "width": "170px",
                "cellChildren": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Div",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-col ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "{{row.status === 'completed' ? 'ecommerce:inline-flex ecommerce:w-fit ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:px-2 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:bg-green-100 ecommerce:text-green-800 ecommerce:dark:bg-green-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-green-300' : row.status === 'processing' ? 'ecommerce:inline-flex ecommerce:w-fit ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:px-2 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:bg-blue-100 ecommerce:text-blue-800 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-blue-300' : row.status === 'failed' ? 'ecommerce:inline-flex ecommerce:w-fit ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:px-2 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:bg-red-100 ecommerce:text-red-800 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-red-300' : 'ecommerce:inline-flex ecommerce:w-fit ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:px-2 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:font-medium ecommerce:bg-gray-200 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300'}}"
                                },
                                "text": "{{row.status_label}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "if": "{{row.status === 'processing'}}",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "ecommerce:w-24 ecommerce:h-1.5 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:bg-gray-200 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:overflow-hidden"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "ecommerce:h-full ecommerce:bg-blue-500 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-400",
                                                    "style": {
                                                        "width": "{{row.progress_percent ?? 0}}%"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                        },
                                        "text": "{{row.progress_percent ?? 0}}%"
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "if": "{{row.status === 'completed'}}",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:defer:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.table.rows|count={{(row.processed_rows ?? 0).toLocaleString()}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "if": "{{row.status === 'failed' && row.error_message}}",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-red-600 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400 ecommerce:whitespace-normal"
                                },
                                "text": "{{row.error_message}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "subRowChildren": [
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Div",
                "props": {
                    "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-wrap ecommerce:gap-x-6 ecommerce:gap-y-1.5"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.scope"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.summary?.scope}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "if": "{{row.summary?.selected_count > 0}}",
                        "text": "$t:defer:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.selected_count|count={{row.summary?.selected_count}}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.period"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.summary?.period}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.row_unit"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.summary?.row_unit}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.fields"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "$t:defer:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.field_count|count={{row.summary?.field_count ?? 0}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.locale_mode"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.summary?.locale_mode}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.totals"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.summary?.include_totals ? $t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.yes') : $t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.no')}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "if": "{{row.cutoff_at}}",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.cutoff_at"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.cutoff_at}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "if": "{{row.completed_at}}",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.completed_at"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.completed_at}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "if": "{{row.file_size_label}}",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.file_size"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.file_size_label}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "if": "{{row.expires_at}}",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.expires_at"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Span",
                                "text": "{{row.expires_at}}"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Div",
                "if": "{{row.reason}}",
                "props": {
                    "className": "ecommerce:mt-2 ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400 ecommerce:shrink-0"
                        },
                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.reason"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:whitespace-pre-line ecommerce:break-all ecommerce-break-all"
                        },
                        "text": "{{row.reason}}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Div",
                "if": "{{(row.warnings ?? []).length > 0}}",
                "props": {
                    "className": "ecommerce:mt-2 ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:flex-wrap"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                        },
                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.warnings"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "iteration": {
                            "source": "row.warnings ?? []",
                            "item_var": "warning"
                        },
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:inline-flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:px-1.5 ecommerce:py-0.5 ecommerce:rounded ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:bg-yellow-100 ecommerce:text-yellow-800 ecommerce:dark:bg-yellow-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-yellow-300"
                        },
                        "text": "{{warning.label}}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Div",
                "if": "{{row.error_message}}",
                "props": {
                    "className": "ecommerce:mt-2 ecommerce:flex ecommerce:gap-1"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400 ecommerce:shrink-0"
                        },
                        "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.sub_row.error"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "ecommerce:text-red-600 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400"
                        },
                        "text": "{{row.error_message}}"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}
